Case 3: \B and \b on multibyte strings, under re2     

===================================================
id    hex(regexp_replace(s, '\B', '-'))    regexp_count(s, '\B')    regexp_instr(s, '\B', 1, 1)    regexp_instr(s, '\B', 1, 2)    hex(regexp_substr(s, '\B', 1, 2))    
2     61EAB0802D     1     3     0     null     
3     2DF09F988061F09F98802D     2     1     4          
4     2DEAB0802D202DEB829861     3     1     2          
5     612D6220632D64     2     2     5          

===================================================
id    hex(regexp_replace(s, '\b', '|'))    regexp_count(s, '\b')    regexp_instr(s, '\b', 1, 2)    
2     7C617CEAB080     2     2     
3     F09F98807C617CF09F9880     2     3     
4     EAB08020EB82987C617C     2     5     
5     7C61627C207C63647C     4     3     

===================================================
id    regexp_replace(s, 'x*', '-')    regexp_count(s, 'x*')    
1     -가-나-다-     4     
2     -a-가-     3     
3     -😀-a-😀-     4     
4     -가- -나-a-     5     
5     -a-b- -c-d-     6     

