Case 4: REGEXP_INSTR on an EUC-KR column, under both engines     

===================================================
regexp_instr(s, '나')    regexp_instr(s, 'a')    regexp_instr(s, '나', 1, 1, 1)    regexp_instr(s, '다', 2)    regexp_count(s, '나')    
2     4     3     3     1     

